{
  "title": "The Bounty Office",
  "subtitle": "Attack path",
  "icon": "minecraft:iron_sword",
  "group": "skills",
  "order": 6,
  "quests": [
    {
      "id": "the_board",
      "title": "Wanted",
      "text": [
        "Bounty Master Corvin Ash posts the office's work on boards in the villages. Find a board and take your first contract from it."
      ],
      "tasks": [
        {
          "talk": "character",
          "character": "corvin",
          "lines": [
            "You want work. Good. Work pays.",
            "The office posts contracts on bounty boards. Every village has one.",
            "Find a board. Take a contract. Don't take one you can't finish.",
            "I've buried hunters who did."
          ]
        },
        {
          "structure": "#villages",
          "title": "Find a village's bounty board"
        },
        {
          "item": "bountiful:bounty",
          "title": "Take a contract from the board"
        }
      ],
      "rewards": [
        {
          "item": "bountiful:bounty-common"
        },
        {
          "skill": "attack",
          "xp": 50
        }
      ],
      "icon": "bountiful:bountyboard"
    },
    {
      "id": "dummy_drills",
      "title": "Drills on the Dummy",
      "after": [
        "the_board"
      ],
      "text": [
        "No hunter goes out untrained. Make a target dummy, then hit it hard and fast for a minute."
      ],
      "tasks": [
        {
          "item": "dummmmmmy:target_dummy",
          "crafted": true
        },
        {
          "timed": {
            "seconds": 60,
            "goal": {
              "stat": "minecraft:damage_dealt",
              "count": 600
            },
            "lines": [
              "Sixty seconds. Hit the dummy.",
              "Combos, not flailing. Go."
            ],
            "start": "Start the drill"
          },
          "title": "Deal the damage in a minute"
        }
      ],
      "rewards": [
        {
          "item": "minecraft:iron_ingot",
          "count": 4
        },
        {
          "skill": "attack",
          "xp": 80
        }
      ],
      "icon": "dummmmmmy:target_dummy"
    },
    {
      "id": "first_contract",
      "title": "Night Shift",
      "after": [
        "dummy_drills"
      ],
      "text": [
        "The first proper contract: the outskirts of a village crawl with zombies of every odd variety. Put down fifteen."
      ],
      "tasks": [
        {
          "structure": "#villages",
          "title": "Reach a village"
        },
        {
          "kill": "minecraft:zombie",
          "count": 15,
          "title": "Put down fifteen zombies"
        }
      ],
      "rewards": [
        {
          "item": "minecraft:bread",
          "count": 8
        },
        {
          "item": "minecraft:emerald",
          "count": 2
        },
        {
          "skill": "attack",
          "xp": 120
        }
      ],
      "icon": "minecraft:zombie_head"
    },
    {
      "id": "the_rascal",
      "title": "The Thief in the Mine",
      "after": [
        "first_contract"
      ],
      "text": [
        "A bounty on a 'thief' who robs miners. The thief is a rascal, and it is playing hide-and-seek in an old mineshaft. Find it three times and it will pay you off."
      ],
      "tasks": [
        {
          "structure": "#mines",
          "title": "Go into the mineshaft"
        },
        {
          "encounter": {
            "entity": "friendsandfoes:rascal",
            "name": "Rascal",
            "where": {
              "below_y": 60
            },
            "then": "talk",
            "lines": [
              "Hee hee! You found me!",
              "Again! Count to ten!"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "encounter": {
            "entity": "friendsandfoes:rascal",
            "name": "Rascal",
            "where": {
              "below_y": 60
            },
            "then": "talk",
            "lines": [
              "Oh! You're good at this.",
              "One more. Go on, I dare you."
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "encounter": {
            "entity": "friendsandfoes:rascal",
            "name": "Rascal",
            "where": {
              "below_y": 60
            },
            "then": "talk",
            "lines": [
              "Found me again! Fine, fine. Take the shiny things.",
              "I only borrowed them. Mostly."
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "rewards": [
        {
          "item": "minecraft:gold_ingot",
          "count": 8
        },
        {
          "item": "minecraft:emerald",
          "count": 6
        },
        {
          "skill": "attack",
          "xp": 160
        }
      ],
      "icon": "friendsandfoes:rascal_spawn_egg"
    },
    {
      "id": "weapon_of_choice",
      "title": "Weapon of Choice",
      "after": [
        "first_contract"
      ],
      "text": [
        "Ash wants you to choose your style. Forge an iron Spartan weapon and wear it like a hunter."
      ],
      "tasks": [
        {
          "item": "spartanweaponry:iron_longsword",
          "crafted": true,
          "title": "Forge an iron Spartan weapon"
        },
        {
          "talk": "character",
          "character": "corvin",
          "lines": [
            "A longsword. Honest steel.",
            "Wear it where you can draw it fast. A weapon in your pack is a weapon you don't have.",
            "Every scar on me came from a blade I reached for too late."
          ]
        }
      ],
      "rewards": [
        {
          "item": "minecraft:grindstone"
        },
        {
          "item": "minecraft:iron_ingot",
          "count": 6
        },
        {
          "skill": "attack",
          "xp": 180
        }
      ],
      "icon": "spartanweaponry:iron_longsword"
    },
    {
      "id": "fallen_adventurer",
      "title": "The Unfinished Contract",
      "after": [
        "weapon_of_choice"
      ],
      "text": [
        "You find the remains of a fallen bounty hunter with a contract still clutched in their bones. You read it, and you can see how it ends."
      ],
      "tasks": [
        {
          "checkmark": "I read the contract"
        }
      ],
      "rewards": [
        {
          "item": "minecraft:writable_book",
          "name": "The Hunter's Journal",
          "lore": [
            "A dead hunter's notes. The last page is unfinished."
          ]
        },
        {
          "skill": "attack",
          "xp": 150
        }
      ],
      "icon": "minecraft:writable_book",
      "discover": {
        "observe": "realmrpg_skeletons:hunted_skeleton",
        "ticks": 20
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "dungeon_sweep",
      "title": "Clearing the Cellar",
      "after": [
        "fallen_adventurer"
      ],
      "text": [
        "The journal points to a dungeon below a village. Go down and clear it."
      ],
      "tasks": [
        {
          "structure": "#yungs_dungeons",
          "title": "Find the dungeon"
        },
        {
          "kill": "minecraft:zombie",
          "count": 8
        },
        {
          "kill": "minecraft:skeleton",
          "count": 8
        }
      ],
      "rewards": [
        {
          "item": "minecraft:iron_ingot",
          "count": 8
        },
        {
          "item": "minecraft:gold_ingot",
          "count": 4
        },
        {
          "item": "minecraft:emerald",
          "count": 4
        },
        {
          "skill": "attack",
          "xp": 200
        }
      ],
      "icon": "minecraft:spawner"
    },
    {
      "id": "spider_queen",
      "title": "Silk and Venom",
      "after": [
        "dungeon_sweep"
      ],
      "text": [
        "A spider dungeon has been sending its brood into the fields. Clear it, and cut the poison sac from its biggest spider as proof."
      ],
      "tasks": [
        {
          "structure": "betterdungeons:spider_dungeon",
          "title": "Find the spider dungeon"
        },
        {
          "kill": "minecraft:cave_spider",
          "count": 12
        },
        {
          "drop": {
            "from": [
              "minecraft:spider"
            ],
            "chance": 0.15,
            "item": {
              "name": "Queen's Poison Sac",
              "tooltip": "Proof of the kill",
              "texture": "minecraft:item/spider_eye"
            }
          },
          "consume": false
        }
      ],
      "rewards": [
        {
          "item": "minecraft:enchanted_book",
          "name": "Bane of the Brood",
          "enchant": {
            "minecraft:bane_of_arthropods": 3
          }
        },
        {
          "skill": "attack",
          "xp": 240
        }
      ],
      "icon": "minecraft:spider_eye"
    },
    {
      "id": "graveyard_shift",
      "title": "Graveyard Shift",
      "after": [
        "dungeon_sweep",
        "main_story:act1_start"
      ],
      "text": [
        "The dead won't stay down in an old graveyard. Spend a night there and put them back in the ground."
      ],
      "tasks": [
        {
          "structure": "#graveyards",
          "title": "Reach the graveyard"
        },
        {
          "kill": "minecraft:zombie",
          "count": 8
        },
        {
          "kill": "minecraft:skeleton",
          "count": 7
        }
      ],
      "rewards": [
        {
          "item": "minecraft:enchanted_book",
          "name": "Rest Easy",
          "enchant": {
            "minecraft:smite": 3
          }
        },
        {
          "skill": "attack",
          "xp": 240
        }
      ],
      "icon": "minecraft:bone"
    },
    {
      "id": "feral_bounty",
      "title": "The Mauler",
      "after": [
        "spider_queen"
      ],
      "text": [
        "A beast-tamer's bounty: a mauler, small, fast and all teeth, has been savaging travellers in the badlands. Find it, survive its rush, and the tamer's feral claws are your pay."
      ],
      "tasks": [
        {
          "encounter": {
            "entity": "friendsandfoes:mauler",
            "name": "The Mauler",
            "health": 40,
            "glow": true,
            "where": {
              "biomes": [
                "minecraft:badlands"
              ]
            },
            "then": "kill",
            "lines": [
              "Grrrrk!"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "rewards": [
        {
          "item": "artifacts:feral_claws"
        },
        {
          "skill": "attack",
          "xp": 300
        }
      ],
      "icon": "artifacts:feral_claws",
      "signature": "artifacts:feral_claws"
    }
  ]
}
